The algorithms of src/PhpDatabase/Writer/Accdb/TextIndexCodes.php and IndexKey.php
follow the index encoding implemented by Jackcess (GeneralLegacyIndexCodes, IndexData).
src/PhpDatabase/Shared/Access/QueryFormat.php follows the query formatting of Jackcess (QueryImpl,
SelectQueryImpl, UnionQueryImpl); the attachment and extended date encodings follow
AttachmentColumnInfoImpl, ColumnImpl and CalculatedColumnUtil.

